# Build snapshots. Earlier work kept a full self-contained publish per
# experiment (.codex-build-check had eleven, ~128 MB each); that is what
# grew this repo past 1.9 GB. Keep experiments out of the tree.
.codex-build-check/
publish-*/
SR160PowerConfig-*/

# The two release binaries in the repo root are tracked on purpose — they
# are the assets attached to each GitHub release — so they are not listed
# here. Anything else a build drops is not.
bin/
obj/
*.pdb

# Written by the old Avalonia app beside its exe; the current build keeps
# its settings in the registry instead.
settings.txt
